AI agents can now break into realistic enterprise networks on their own. A capability once limited to trusted-access programs is available to anyone.

Today we’re releasing Vals CyberOffense.

@willknight  from @WIRED wrote an article about our work, link in the thread. https://t.co/COhkeOfw97

Anthropic has explored ways to make AI models believe they're not being evaluated, including directly manipulating their internal representations.

"It's almost like a drug that you can give the AI to change its beliefs."

@JBloomAus of the UK @AISecurityInst explains how https://t.co/jWiDBOFrnT
